  "text": "Here is the result of \"fetch\" for the Page with URL https://app.notion.com/p/3ec1956a9b0e80e48a34f1c44b6d532d as of 2026-10-05T12:25:20.328Z:\n<page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3ec1956a9b0e80e48a34f1c44b6d532d\">\n<ancestor-path>\n<parent-data-source url=\"collection://8d44f836-e48d-4ab7-afa1-1b88280cd4fc\" name=\"Goal\"/>\n<ancestor-2-database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/4596d2b0d23b4964a9de0166e1213450\" title=\"\"/>\n<ancestor-3-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/b58d1d6424d34f10ab6a2e239825cdbf\" title=\"Goal\"/>\n</ancestor-path>\n<properties>\n{\"Created\":\"2026-10-01T15:19:25.790Z\",\"Name\":\"MCP AI開發\",\"url\":\"https://app.notion.com/p/3ec1956a9b0e80e48a34f1c44b6d532d\",\"userDefined:URL\":\"\"}\n</properties>\n<iconMetadata>null</iconMetadata>\n<content>\n## MCP AI｜多專案入口 {color=\"blue\"}\n<callout icon=\"🧠\" color=\"blue_bg\">\n\t此頁只負責 **MCP / AI 多專案導航**。每張卡片是一個獨立研發專案；Roadmap、開發資料庫、技術文件、知識管理與 Agent 指令都放在卡片下一層。\n</callout>\n### Project Cards\n<columns>\n\t<column ratio=\"50\">\n\t\t<callout icon=\"🧩\" color=\"blue_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e818397b2d8b45118af51\"/><br>RiR 視覺化產品層、Layer-first、Computational BIM、Use → Logic → GH Advanced。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t\t<callout icon=\"🧱\" color=\"purple_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e8181b873c7c5770c2188\"/><br>地下捷運公共牆面、自動切立面／剖面、接合長立面與圖紙化。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t\t<callout icon=\"🎛️\" color=\"pink_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e8187a2b0fe8662dbf64c\"/><br>Dockable Panel、WebView、Workflow visualization、Agent feedback 與視覺系統。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"50\">\n\t\t<callout icon=\"☀️\" color=\"green_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e81f0a52fc11e84c1d86c\"/><br>日照、陰影、日射、風、熱舒適與環境分析視覺化平台。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t\t<callout icon=\"🪟\" color=\"blue_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e81e8a462d89ed37df749\"/><br>Surface → Grid → Panel → Mullion → Revit 的參數化帷幕工作流。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t\t<callout icon=\"🗂️\" color=\"gray_bg\">\n\t\t\t<mention-database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/35814e3d145442b0990e933f547885f7\">MCP AI｜專案入口</mention-database><br>查看全部專案狀態、領域、優先級與目前焦點。\n\t\t</callout>\n\t</column>\n</columns>\n---\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/35814e3d145442b0990e933f547885f7\" inline=\"false\" data-source-url=\"collection://a232d4a1-a38f-4a0d-9653-c87407ae7e36\">MCP AI｜專案入口</database>\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f01956a9b0e81fc80eac8a313959520\" inline=\"true\" data-source-url=\"collection://a232d4a1-a38f-4a0d-9653-c87407ae7e36\"></database>\n</content>\n</page>",
